title: "Drone Image Cleaning Pipeline for UAV-Based Wheat Phenotyping"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-01-01"
authors:
  - family-names: "Kinz"
    given-names: "Gudrun"
    affiliation: "University of Natural Resources and Life Sciences Vienna (BOKU)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/drone-image-cleaning-pipeline"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A metadata-based pipeline for quality-filtering UAV images acquired during
  wheat phenotyping campaigns. The pipeline processes Phase One IIQ image
  metadata through six sequential stages (flight segmentation, yaw filtering,
  altitude filtering, slope/trajectory filtering, and Grubbs outlier detection)
  to remove images of inferior quality without any pixel-level processing.
keywords:
  - UAV
  - wheat phenotyping
  - image data cleaning
  - remote sensing
  - metadata filtering
  - Grubbs test
  - Phase One IIQ
